# Vercel builds the frontend only. There is no Python runtime on the deployment, which
# is why the hosted app runs in offline mode against the precomputed fixtures in
# app/public/data and says so in the sidebar. The solver, the models and the FastAPI
# service run locally, see the README.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading slash. Without it, data/ would also match
# app/public/data and the hosted app would have no fixtures to read.
/requirements.txt
/*.py
/api
/ml
/physics
/pinn
/python_stats
/research
/data
/HANDOFF.md
/HANDOFF_part1.md
/HANDOFF_part2.md
/HANDOFF_part3.md
